WEBVTT

1
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.416
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:01:06.416 --> 00:01:10.916
the need to remember Him at the time of death.

3
00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:13.375
In these verses, He describes in detail

4
00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:16.750
that deep process of yoga and meditation

5
00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:20.625
which enables the seeker,
 especially at the time of death,

6
00:01:20.625 --> 00:01:23.625
to attain the supreme goal.

7
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:33.208
Krishna introduces the method of yoga, saying:

8
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.791
sarva-dvārāṇi saṁyamya,

9
00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:41.458
meaning controlling all senses
 or gates of knowledge.

10
00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:45.416
These senses are mediums for
 connecting with external objects.

11
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:47.875
To begin practice, the yogi

12
00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:52.708
withdraws the senses from their subjects 
and makes the mind inward-looking.

13
00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:54.791
Then Krishna instructs the seeker

14
00:01:54.791 --> 00:01:57.833
to stabilize their mind,

15
00:01:57.833 --> 00:02:01.875
which symbolizes focusing on the real soul.

16
00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:03.583
After this, He explains

17
00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:05.583
how the yogi focuses prāṇa

18
00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:06.750
at the region

19
00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:09.500
between the eyebrows.

20
00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.250
For this, yoga-dhāraṇā is needed,

21
00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:17.125
meaning a developed form of meditation.

22
00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:18.125
Lord Krishna

23
00:02:18.125 --> 00:02:19.208
then explains the role

24
00:02:19.208 --> 00:02:21.750
of Om in this practice –

25
00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:24.875
'Om ity ekākșaram brahma,'

26
00:02:24.875 --> 00:02:27.083
Om is the eternal sound

27
00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:29.000
representing Brahma.

28
00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.166
The seeker

29
00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:32.291
should remember Krishna

30
00:02:32.291 --> 00:02:34.541
while chanting Om:

31
00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:36.875
mām anusmaran.

32
00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:39.000
This shows that chanting Om

33
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.708
is part of the process,

34
00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:42.500
but attention should remain on Lord Krishna,

35
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:46.208
meaning on the Supreme Puruṣa.

36
00:02:46.208 --> 00:02:48.500
The culmination of this practice

37
00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.541
is called 'sa yāti paramām gatim' –

38
00:02:51.541 --> 00:02:54.208
attaining the supreme goal.

39
00:02:54.208 --> 00:02:56.166
Whether the yogi reaches Vaikuṇṭha

40
00:02:56.166 --> 00:02:58.500
or merges into Brahma

41
00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.083
depends on the level

42
00:03:00.083 --> 00:03:02.708
of devotion in their yoga practice.

43
00:03:02.708 --> 00:03:05.750
Ultimately, remembrance of
 Krishna is necessary

44
00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.416
for attaining the highest goal.

45
00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:10.250
In the coming verses,

46
00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.541
Lord Krishna will reveal even more aspects

47
00:03:13.541 --> 00:03:15.250
of this yoga process.

48
00:03:19.916 --> 00:03:23.125
Have you ever thought

49
00:03:23.125 --> 00:03:26.333
that one seeking light

50
00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:32.125
must also befriend darkness?

51
00:03:32.125 --> 00:03:34.166
In life, often you see

52
00:03:34.166 --> 00:03:38.708
those walking the spiritual path

53
00:03:38.708 --> 00:03:41.875
only from an external view.

54
00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:44.083
You might think

55
00:03:44.083 --> 00:03:47.125
that sages and saints

56
00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:51.041
live a simple, carefree life.

57
00:03:51.041 --> 00:03:56.458
But when you understand the
 real depth of spiritual practice,

58
00:03:56.458 --> 00:03:58.500
then you'll know

59
00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.750
what disciplined and dedicated life

60
00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:06.541
true sages live.

61
00:04:06.541 --> 00:04:08.791
Just as gold

62
00:04:08.791 --> 00:04:12.500
becomes pure only after being heated in fire,

63
00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.666
similarly the soul

64
00:04:14.666 --> 00:04:17.833
walking the spiritual path

65
00:04:17.833 --> 00:04:20.833
also gets refined through austerity.

66
00:04:20.833 --> 00:04:24.291
This path is neither easy

67
00:04:24.291 --> 00:04:26.958
nor smooth.

68
00:04:26.958 --> 00:04:30.583
It includes restraint of senses,

69
00:04:30.583 --> 00:04:32.500
stabilization of mind,

70
00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:37.166
and regulation of life-force –

71
00:04:37.166 --> 00:04:39.000
that too with complete concentration

72
00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.208
toward the supreme element.

73
00:04:42.208 --> 00:04:46.666
This is the path of complete self-surrender,

74
00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:50.583
where years of practice are necessary

75
00:04:50.583 --> 00:04:55.375
to gain control over mind and body.

76
00:04:55.375 --> 00:04:57.416
Do you know how deep

77
00:04:57.416 --> 00:05:01.458
what you consider simple practice

78
00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.708
how deep it is?

79
00:05:03.708 --> 00:05:07.166
Even a huge elephant

80
00:05:07.166 --> 00:05:10.083
is very small at birth,

81
00:05:10.083 --> 00:05:13.583
later becomes massive.

82
00:05:13.583 --> 00:05:15.333
Similarly,

83
00:05:15.333 --> 00:05:18.625
great spiritual achievement

84
00:05:18.625 --> 00:05:22.541
also begins with small practice.

85
00:05:22.541 --> 00:05:24.750
Sages also stabilize the mind

86
00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:28.708
through small small practices!

87
00:05:28.708 --> 00:05:33.500
Chant the Lord's name with awareness!

88
00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.916
Do pratyāhāra!

89
00:05:35.916 --> 00:05:38.708
Pratyāhāra means

90
00:05:38.708 --> 00:05:43.291
saving the restless senses
 from wandering in desires

91
00:05:43.291 --> 00:05:47.416
and bringing them back
 toward meditation on the Lord.

92
00:05:47.416 --> 00:05:51.541
These seekers aren't escaping from life,

93
00:05:51.541 --> 00:05:54.208
rather they've set out

94
00:05:54.208 --> 00:05:58.166
on the most difficult inner journey.

95
00:05:58.166 --> 00:06:00.875
Therefore, next time

96
00:06:00.875 --> 00:06:04.000
you see a seeker,

97
00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:08.166
recognize the difficulty of their path.

98
00:06:08.166 --> 00:06:11.916
Show respect, understanding

99
00:06:11.916 --> 00:06:15.000
that true spiritual practice

100
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.583
wants not only external discipline

101
00:06:18.583 --> 00:06:21.708
but also expects a

102
00:06:21.708 --> 00:06:24.916
completely dedicated heart

103
00:06:24.916 --> 00:06:27.333
in search of supreme truth.

104
00:06:27.333 --> 00:06:29.458
One who conquers

105
00:06:29.458 --> 00:06:31.208
the senses,

106
00:06:31.208 --> 00:06:33.500
conquers

107
00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.708
the world.

108
00:06:40.416 --> 00:06:41.875
You often remain entangled

109
00:06:41.875 --> 00:06:46.166
in the rush of family life.

110
00:06:46.166 --> 00:06:48.041
In this rush,

111
00:06:48.041 --> 00:06:51.500
controlling the senses becomes difficult,

112
00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:56.000
many desires distract them by attracting.

113
00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.041
Then concentrating the mind

114
00:06:58.041 --> 00:07:00.750
also becomes very difficult.

115
00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:03.875
In such a case, you might think,

116
00:07:03.875 --> 00:07:05.833
'How is this practice possible

117
00:07:05.833 --> 00:07:09.041
amidst daily obligations?'

118
00:07:09.041 --> 00:07:12.541
But don't be discouraged.

119
00:07:12.541 --> 00:07:15.916
The essence of My teaching is

120
00:07:15.916 --> 00:07:19.250
that you keep Me in remembrance.

121
00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:23.541
Especially in life's final moment,

122
00:07:23.541 --> 00:07:26.291
while uttering My name

123
00:07:26.291 --> 00:07:29.583
or Om. 

124
00:07:29.583 --> 00:07:30.833
Look,

125
00:07:30.833 --> 00:07:35.583
just as a river takes many turns in its flow

126
00:07:35.583 --> 00:07:39.041
but keeps moving toward the ocean,

127
00:07:39.041 --> 00:07:42.208
similarly even while going through

128
00:07:42.208 --> 00:07:44.666
many circumstances in householder life,

129
00:07:44.666 --> 00:07:50.250
attaining the spiritual goal is possible.

130
00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:51.750
You don't need to go

131
00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:55.708
to the ultimate limit of renunciation.

132
00:07:55.708 --> 00:08:00.458
You can move yourself

133
00:08:00.458 --> 00:08:02.541
and family forward on the path of truth

134
00:08:02.541 --> 00:08:06.791
through small small daily practices.

135
00:08:06.791 --> 00:08:08.666
Offer your senses

136
00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:12.375
and mind in My service –

137
00:08:12.375 --> 00:08:15.166
whether it's simple prayer,

138
00:08:15.166 --> 00:08:19.041
chanting My name, scripture reading,

139
00:08:19.041 --> 00:08:23.916
or lovingly serving family members.

140
00:08:23.916 --> 00:08:25.750
A mother

141
00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:29.250
who takes My name while singing

142
00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.541
lullaby to her child,

143
00:08:31.541 --> 00:08:34.208
isn't she doing spiritual practice?

144
00:08:34.208 --> 00:08:37.250
A person who reaches home

145
00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:41.000
and helps wife in household work,

146
00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.208
takes their child along

147
00:08:43.208 --> 00:08:46.041
for evening ārati,

148
00:08:46.041 --> 00:08:50.000
isn't he following dharma?

149
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:56.208
When you include these
 simple practices in your life,

150
00:08:56.208 --> 00:08:58.041
then My remembrance becomes

151
00:08:58.041 --> 00:09:01.666
your natural tendency,

152
00:09:01.666 --> 00:09:03.333
which will guide you

153
00:09:03.333 --> 00:09:07.375
in the final moment.

154
00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:09.750
This yoga of remembrance

155
00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.875
emphasizes more than difficult practices

156
00:09:11.875 --> 00:09:14.500
how to adopt

157
00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:17.750
its essence

158
00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:19.583
in family life!

159
00:09:19.583 --> 00:09:22.583
By remembering Me daily,

160
00:09:22.583 --> 00:09:27.625
you prepare a calm and focused mind

161
00:09:27.625 --> 00:09:31.666
for the final moment.

162
00:09:31.666 --> 00:09:36.416
In this way, even in busy householder life,

163
00:09:36.416 --> 00:09:39.708
you can successfully prepare

164
00:09:39.708 --> 00:09:44.208
for your supreme journey.

165
00:09:44.208 --> 00:09:46.125
The home where

166
00:09:46.125 --> 00:09:49.500
My name resonates

167
00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:51.958
becomes a pilgrimage place.

168
00:09:56.708 --> 00:10:00.500
In an office, a manager

169
00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:02.541
is in an important meeting

170
00:10:02.541 --> 00:10:05.375
with their employees.

171
00:10:05.375 --> 00:10:08.333
External stress, lack of time,

172
00:10:08.333 --> 00:10:13.166
and pressure of goals are distracting them.

173
00:10:13.166 --> 00:10:14.250
In such a case,

174
00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:18.000
the importance of self-control gets highlighted.

175
00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:21.500
In your professional life, self-restraint

176
00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:27.250
is as important as it is for a yogi.

177
00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.750
To reach the peak of success,

178
00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:33.208
control over your senses

179
00:10:33.208 --> 00:10:36.500
and concentrating the mind on the goal

180
00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.083
is essential for you.

181
00:10:38.083 --> 00:10:40.583
Just as a heron bird

182
00:10:40.583 --> 00:10:44.541
focuses its vision on the fish, similarly

183
00:10:44.541 --> 00:10:47.625
you too should focus complete attention

184
00:10:47.625 --> 00:10:51.833
on your work's goal.

185
00:10:51.833 --> 00:10:53.916
Just as

186
00:10:53.916 --> 00:10:55.750
I tell the yogi

187
00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:59.083
pratyāhāra of senses, meaning

188
00:10:59.083 --> 00:11:04.041
freeing the senses from their desires,

189
00:11:04.041 --> 00:11:05.208
I instruct the senses

190
00:11:05.208 --> 00:11:09.208
to become inward-looking,

191
00:11:09.208 --> 00:11:12.500
similarly at the workplace

192
00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:15.833
you must avoid distraction, meaning wandering,

193
00:11:15.833 --> 00:11:19.541
and stop yourself from getting excited.

194
00:11:19.541 --> 00:11:22.708
The implication of this self-control is

195
00:11:22.708 --> 00:11:24.625
not reacting immediately

196
00:11:24.625 --> 00:11:26.541
to circumstances,

197
00:11:26.541 --> 00:11:29.291
skillfully managing stress, and

198
00:11:29.291 --> 00:11:32.583
not getting distracted by momentary obstacles.

199
00:11:32.583 --> 00:11:34.333
Keep in mind,

200
00:11:34.333 --> 00:11:37.083
patience and seriousness

201
00:11:37.083 --> 00:11:38.541
are extremely necessary

202
00:11:38.541 --> 00:11:42.416
for lasting success in the professional field.

203
00:11:42.416 --> 00:11:43.791
Just as a yogi

204
00:11:43.791 --> 00:11:46.583
remains absorbed in unbroken samādhi,

205
00:11:46.583 --> 00:11:50.250
similarly you too must learn
 to keep your mind stable

206
00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:56.416
on your actions and long-term objectives.

207
00:11:56.416 --> 00:11:59.250
Although this is never easy,

208
00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:01.708
especially while living

209
00:12:01.708 --> 00:12:04.708
amidst daily pressures and attractions.

210
00:12:04.708 --> 00:12:08.666
But through continuous effort and discipline,

211
00:12:08.666 --> 00:12:12.208
you'll develop that inner strength

212
00:12:12.208 --> 00:12:13.833
which is extremely necessary

213
00:12:13.833 --> 00:12:17.875
for lasting success in the professional field.

214
00:12:17.875 --> 00:12:21.333
Yoga is possible even in the field of action.

215
00:12:21.333 --> 00:12:25.500
Yoga is the ultimate form of excellence.

216
00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:29.250
When you practice self-restraint,

217
00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:32.250
then capability to make good decisions,

218
00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:37.666
clean and clear perspective, 
and on the strength of your ability,

219
00:12:37.666 --> 00:12:40.208
you develop a successful

220
00:12:40.208 --> 00:12:42.916
style of working.

221
00:12:42.916 --> 00:12:44.666
Because of these qualities,

222
00:12:44.666 --> 00:12:48.416
your skillfulness in work, dedication in karma,

223
00:12:48.416 --> 00:12:51.250
and detachment in results –

224
00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:55.625
this is the practical form of yoga.
